---

PROHIBITED USES

The following uses are not permitted:

- Providing the Software as a hosted execution service (including web apps, APIs,
  SaaS platforms, or cloud-based runners)
- Charging users for access to execution of the Software (including subscriptions,
  pay-per-run, API fees, or similar monetization models)
- Operating any service where the primary function is executing code submitted by
  users on infrastructure controlled by a third party using the Software
- Misrepresenting systems built with the Software as something they are not
  (e.g., labeling deterministic or rule-based systems as “AI” when they are not)

---

ALLOWED USES

The following uses are explicitly permitted:

- Running the Software locally on any machine under user control
- Using VPS, cloud servers, containers, or remote environments to run the Software,
  provided execution remains user-controlled and not sold as a service
- Using the Software in general-purpose hosting platforms where it is only one tool
  among many
- Building and selling software created with the Software (games, applications,
  tools, services), including monetization via sales, subscriptions, or ads
- Developing IDEs, editors, debuggers, and other developer tools that improve the
  Software experience
- Educational content, tutorials, and videos, including monetized content on
  third-party platforms, provided they do not form a paid execution service
- Sponsorships and advertising within educational content, provided they are
  reasonable and not designed as exploitative ad-extraction systems

---

ATTRIBUTION

Redistributions of the Software or substantial portions thereof must include
this license and appropriate attribution to the original project.

Attribution is encouraged for software built using the Software where practical,
but is not required if the software is fully open-source or attribution is
already clearly visible in source materials.

---

EXECUTION PRINCIPLE

The Software is intended to remain locally executable.

It must always be possible for users to execute the Software without requiring
payment, subscription, or remote authorization.

The Software shall not be used as a hosted runtime product, API service, or
cloud execution platform.

